question:
In each of the following pair, identify molecular species with the higher entropy [assuming constant temperature except in (c)]
(a) 1 mole of solid KBr or 1 mole of an aqueous KBr;
(b) 1 mole of SO2 or 1 mole of SO3;
(c) sea water in mid-winter at 2 °C or in mid-summer at 23 °C;
(d) 3 moles of oxygen gas or 2 moles of ozone gas
(e) 1 mole of CO2 solid or 1 mole of CO2 gas
